OL,3,AWhy wait? Business grads buying firms
OL,4,Ato install themselves as CEO
OL,5,
OL,6,FConfined to her hospital bed as she
OL,7,Fwaited for her baby to be induced, Ania
OL,8,FAliev was attempting to finalise a deal
OL,9,Fto buy a company and put herself in the
OL,10,Ftop job.
OL,12,F"I was answering investors and emailing
OL,13,Fpeople, and the investors were yelling
OL,14,Fat me 'you need to focus on having your
OL,15,Fchild right now!'," says Aliev, who was
OL,16,F27-years-old at the time in late 2023.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
