OL,3,AWhy wait? Business grads buying firms
OL,4,Ato install themselves as CEO
OL,5,
OL,6,FA recent MBA (Master of Business
OL,7,FAdministration) graduate from the
OL,8,Fprestigious Tuck School of Business at
OL,9,FDartmouth College in New Hampshire, she
OL,10,Fgave birth to a boy. Just three months
OL,11,Flater she was owner and CEO of
OL,12,FMassachusetts-based medical equipment
OL,13,Fbusiness Life Support Systems.
OL,15,FIt used to be the case that US business
OL,16,Fcourse graduates would leave university
OL,17,Fand typically either join a corporate
OL,18,Fgiant to try to work their way to the
OL,19,Ftop, or else form their own start-up.
